sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant P as Prometheus
  participant AM as Alertmanager
  participant GW as gateway
  participant DB as Postgres
  participant AG as agent
  P->>P: rule HighErrorRatio for 30s
  P->>AM: firing alert {service, severity, startsAt}
  AM->>GW: POST /api/v1/alerts/alertmanager · Bearer integration token
  GW->>GW: require aud sentinel-alerts + scope alerts:write · tenant from token
  GW->>DB: BEGIN · pg_advisory_xact_lock(tenant/service)
  alt this fingerprint has an active incident
    GW->>DB: fire_count + 1 → deduplicated
  else another alert on this service has an active incident
    GW->>DB: link fingerprint → that incident → correlated
  else
    GW->>DB: INSERT incident (opened_at = startsAt, source alertmanager) + link → opened
  end
  GW->>DB: COMMIT
  GW-->>AM: 202 {opened, deduplicated, correlated, resolved, skipped}
  GW-)AG: investigate in background (trace context propagated)
  Note over AM,GW: later: status resolved → stamp alert_resolved_at when the incident's last alert clears
